"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T21:39:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T21:39:00Z","body":"That makes sense, in the general terminology \"highlighting\" would mean something different that's what's was confusing ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3185915443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3220049816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109587#issuecomment-3220049816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109587","id":3220049816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_7g-Y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-25T12:20:24Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T12:20:24Z","body":"When changing scenes via quick open (Ctrl+Shift+O), the file does not get selected.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3220049816/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250729749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109587#issuecomment-3250729749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109587","id":3250729749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BwjMV","user":{"login":"tle-oops","id":7878845,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Nzg4NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7878845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops","html_url":"https://github.com/tle-oops","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T20:44:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T15:19:02Z","body":"> When changing scenes via quick open (Ctrl+Shift+O), the file does not get selected.\r\n\r\n\r\nLooks like the signal for tab_changed is suppressed by this code here in `EditorSceneTabs::_update_tab_titles()`\r\n```\r\nint current_tab = EditorNode::get_editor_data().get_edited_scene();\r\nif (scene_tabs->get_tab_count() > 0 && scene_tabs->get_current_tab() != current_tab) {\r\nscene_tabs->set_block_signals(true);\r\nscene_tabs->set_current_tab(current_tab);\r\nscene_tabs->set_block_signals(false);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot entirely sure if this is intentional? It seems to work correctly if I just remove the two block_signals calls.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250729749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3256354519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109587#issuecomment-3256354519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109587","id":3256354519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CGAbX","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T23:30:50Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T23:30:50Z","body":"Blocking the signal is intentional, as otherwise that method would get called again from the signal emitted from that method, potentially causing an infinite loop.\r\nThe EditorSceneTabs tab_changed signal is only intended to tell the EditorNode that a tab has been clicked via the tab bar, as the EditorNode is what handles the changing the scene. So this shouldn't use the signal, and instead be triggered from `EditorNode::_set_current_scene_nocheck` or somewhere.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3256354519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3258376321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109587#issuecomment-3258376321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109587","id":3258376321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CNuCB","user":{"login":"tle-oops","id":7878845,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Nzg4NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7878845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops","html_url":"https://github.com/tle-oops","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tle-oops/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-05T13:33:43Z","updated_at":"2025-09-05T13:33:43Z","body":"I see!! thanks @kitbdev  for the clarification.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3258376321/reactions","total_